  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet finds a gap between two ribs, angling slightly upwards as it glances off the lower one. Tearing a furrow through the muscle and meat of your chestwall it fails to penetrate your ribcage, ending up lodged underneath the upper rib.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1). You also count as @Condition[Fatigued] (1) until you pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test (rolling at the start of each of your subsequent turns). </p><p><strong>Surgery (Hard)</strong> is required for Extraction.</p>"
